flowchart TD
  A["1. Capture and describe a change"]
  B["2. Save a visual instruction"]
  C["3. Validate selection and snapshot inputs"]
  D["4. Start Codex in the selected project"]
  E["5. Process messages, status and usage"]
  F["6. Review the saved result in the UI"]
  S[("state.json<br/>Instructions · runs · events · settings")]
  W["Application files"]
  A -->|POST /api/instructions| B
  B -->|POST /api/execute| C
  C -->|thread/start + turn/start| D
  D -->|Notifications| E
  E -->|Save output and status| S
  B -. Save instruction .-> S
  C -. Save snapshot .-> S
  D -->|Edit directly| W
  S -->|GET /api/state every 2 seconds| F
  classDef step fill:#fbfaf7,stroke:#8da699,color:#26322f,stroke-width:1px;
  classDef store fill:#e7efe9,stroke:#49725e,color:#214b3d,stroke-width:1.5px;
  classDef workspace fill:#f5f0e5,stroke:#a38c61,color:#594720;
  class A,B,C,D,E,F step;
  class S store;
  class W workspace;
